</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/22c0c8c2-be68-11f0-b76c-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/Japon-Sanae-Takaichi-Premiere-Ministre.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/22c0c8c2-be68-11f0-b76c-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/Japon-Sanae-Takaichi-Premiere-Ministre.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">5261d28c-9690-11f1-b153-937e0ffee9ad</guid><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 20:56:55 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>肖曼</dc:creator></item><item><category>政治</category><title>美国捣毁假结婚团伙：11人被捕，其中10人在入籍美国前是中国公民</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB/20260812-%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E6%8D%A3%E6%AF%81%E5%81%87%E7%BB%93%E5%A9%9A%E5%9B%A2%E4%BC%99-11%E4%BA%BA%E8%A2%AB%E6%8D%95%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD10%E4%BA%BA%E5%9C%A8%E5%85%A5%E7%B1%8D%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E5%89%8D%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%85%AC%E6%B0%91</link><description>
